# Stradivarius violin — buyable listings and channels (compiled 2026-05-16)

This file was assembled from public web search at the time above. No automated process can exhaustively index the entire internet; treat this as a curated snapshot of verifiable URLs and well-known acquisition channels. Prices and availability change; confirm on the source site or by contacting the seller.

---

## How genuine Stradivari instruments are usually “bought”

Authentic Antonio Stradivari violins almost never appear as ordinary e‑commerce SKUs. They trade by private treaty through specialist dealers, or at major auction houses, after provenance review and bidder registration. Expect seven- to eight-figure USD pricing for accepted examples.

---

