## Mass-market / copy instruments labeled “Stradivarius” or “Strad model” (ordinarily buyable online)

These are **not** Antonio Stradivari originals; they are modern instruments, replicas, or marketing names.

1. **Kennedy Violins — David Yale Heritage “Titian” 1715 Stradivarius model**  
   - https://kennedyviolins.com/products/david-yale-heritage-series-titan-1715-stradivarius-violin  

2. **Kennedy Violins — David Yale Signature Series Strad model**  
   - https://kennedyviolins.com/products/david-yale-signature-series-strad-model-violin  

3. **Miami String Haus — “1732 Stradivarius Violin Copy”**  
   - https://miamistring.com/products/1732-stradivarius-violin-copy-4-4-size  

4. **Antonio Strad Violin (dealer) — Peter White Antonio Stradivari model**  
   - https://www.stradviolin.com/shop/instruments/professional-violins/peter-white-antonio-stradivari-model-violin-258/  

